#   a home: add `pin <Name> -> <Type>` under "pins";
#   a name: edit the third column of its line in the rename list;
#   a class or an actor stays a type where it is: add `keep <Name>` under "pins".
# Run `osy restructure --plan` again: it keeps your lines and checks each one.
# `osy restructure --apply` moves exactly the rows below, and refuses a plan the code no longer gives.
